  "body": "http://jsfiddle.net/h7e1vLp6/1/\r\n\r\nMy reading of the spec: we should get\r\n\r\n```\r\ndrop: effectAllowed = all, dropEffect = link\r\ndragend: effectAllowed = all, dropEffect = none\r\n```\r\n\r\nbecause we reach \"Otherwise: Reset the [current drag operation](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#current-drag-operation) to \"[none](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-current-drag-operation-none)\" in step 4.1.3 of the algorithm below https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#current-drag-operation , i.e. after firing `drop` and before firing `dragend`.\r\n\r\nFirefox on Linux:\r\n\r\n```\r\ndrop: effectAllowed = all, dropEffect = link\r\ndragend: effectAllowed = all, dropEffect = link\r\n```\r\n\r\nChrome on Linux:\r\n\r\n```\r\ndrop: effectAllowed = all, dropEffect = none\r\ndragend: effectAllowed = all, dropEffect = link\r\n```\r\n",
